  "mcpServers": {
    "MCP_DOCKER": {
      "command": "docker",
      "args": ["mcp", "gateway", "run", "--profile", "claude-work"]
    }
  }
}
```

While your VS Code configuration uses a different profile:

```json
{
  "mcp": {
    "servers": {
      "MCP_DOCKER": {
        "command": "docker",
        "args": ["mcp", "gateway", "run", "--profile", "vscode-dev"],
        "type": "stdio"
      }
    }
  }
}
